@page "/"

<PageTitle>IngaCookBook · A little better, every batch</PageTitle>
<section class="welcome-hero">
    <FluentGrid Spacing="8">
        <FluentGridItem Xs="12" Md="7">
            <p class="eyebrow">YOUR KITCHEN. YOUR CURIOSITY.</p>
            <h1>A little better,<br />every batch.</h1>
            <p class="lede">A thoughtful home for your recipes, experiments, and delicious discoveries. Remember what changed. Understand what worked. Make it again.</p>
            <AuthorizeView>
                <Authorized><a class="action-link primary" href="/recipes">Open your recipe notebook →</a></Authorized>
                <NotAuthorized><FluentStack Wrap="true" HorizontalGap="var(--spacingHorizontalM)"><a class="action-link primary" href="/Account/Register">Start your notebook</a><a class="action-link" href="/Account/Login">Welcome back</a></FluentStack></NotAuthorized>
            </AuthorizeView>
            <p class="welcome-footnote">For ice cream, sourdough, your signature sauce,<br />and the next idea you can't wait to try.</p>
        </FluentGridItem>
        <FluentGridItem Xs="12" Md="5">
            <aside class="example-notebook" aria-label="Example recipe development history">
                <p class="eyebrow">A GLIMPSE INSIDE · EXAMPLE</p>
                <FluentIcon Value="@(new Icons.Regular.Size48.Food())" aria-hidden="true" />
                <h2>The vanilla project</h2><p class="muted">One question. A small change. A new discovery.</p>
                <ol class="example-history"><li><span class="badge">V1 · THE STARTING POINT</span><p>Lovely flavor. A little too firm.</p></li><li><span class="badge">V2 · A SMALL EXPERIMENT</span><p>Try a different sugar balance.</p></li><li><span class="badge standard">V3 · THE ONE TO KEEP</span><p>Smooth, scoopable, just right.</p></li></ol>
            </aside>
        </FluentGridItem>
    </FluentGrid>
</section>
<FluentGrid Spacing="5" Class="welcome-features">
    <FluentGridItem Xs="12" Sm="4"><section class="notebook-panel"><span class="eyebrow">01 / CAPTURE</span><h2>Keep the details</h2><p>Ingredients, exact amounts, preparation steps, and photos. Everything you need to make it again.</p></section></FluentGridItem>
    <FluentGridItem Xs="12" Sm="4"><section class="notebook-panel"><span class="eyebrow">02 / DISCOVER</span><h2>Give taste a voice</h2><p>Your criteria, your scores, your observations. Let each tasting guide the next small experiment.</p></section></FluentGridItem>
    <FluentGridItem Xs="12" Sm="4"><section class="notebook-panel"><span class="eyebrow">03 / REFINE</span><h2>See what made it better</h2><p>Follow the story of a recipe, compare changes, and keep a favorite as your standard.</p></section></FluentGridItem>
</FluentGrid>
